Wait: `phone.className = 'phone'` wipes classes; good. But the screen job needs `cracks` visible; internal jobs screen intact. Also `job.part` for water is 'battery' but we don't remove it; focus maybe on battery for the reconnect. Fine.

The interior overlays: create in init:
```
const wetLayer = document.createElement('div'); wetLayer.className='wet-layer';
